        "raw": "<p>I&#39;m not entirely sure, If he is destroyed, but there are still devices in play, I would assume yes because his rules state to remove his character card, but doesn&#39;t say anything about playing his deck. Since the game is still going on you would still play a card, you just wouldn&#39;t recycle cards from the trash or play an additional card anymore. That&#39;s how I interpret the rules anyway.</p>",
